{"title":"我会常务副会长单位——易达科技三款数字产品上架广州数据交易所，获得数据资产登记凭证","date":"2024-07-19","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">我会常务副会长单位</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&mdash;&mdash;<span style=\"letter-spacing:.4pt\">易达科技</span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><span style=\"letter-spacing:.4pt\">三款数字产品上架广州数据交易所，获得数据资产登记凭证</span></span></b><b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:38.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">2024</span><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">年<span lang=\"EN-US\">7</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">8</span>日，广州市天河区成功举行广州数据交易所（天河）服务专区（下称天河服务专区）运营大厅启用典礼。会上为<span lang=\"EN-US\">26</span>款数据产品颁发数据资产登记凭证，其中我会常务副会长单位</span><span class=\"wxsearchkeywordwrap\"><b><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">易达科技</span></b></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&ldquo;造价指标数字证书&rdquo;、&ldquo;工程造价咨询企业执业能力数字证书&rdquo;和&ldquo;工程造价咨询企业诚信评价数字证书&rdquo;均获颁数据资产登记凭证。</span></strong></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/123(1).jpg\" style=\"width: 708px; height: 492px;\" /><o:p></o:p></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph\">\r\n\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 18pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: rgb(2, 72, 125); letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">积极发展数据要素新质生产力<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-top:0cm;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:7.8pt;margin-left:0cm;\r\nmso-para-margin-top:0cm;mso-para-margin-right:0cm;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\nmso-para-margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;\r\ntext-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black\">目前，广州数据交易所天河区的会员数量已增至<span lang=\"EN-US\">188</span>家，其中易达作为会员之一，积极参与并贡献于这一平台的运营和发展。此次广州数据交易所为易达科技的<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>造价指标数字证书<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>、<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>工程造价咨询企业执业能力数字证书<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>和<span lang=\"EN-US\">&ldquo;</span>工程造价咨询企业诚信评价数字证书<span lang=\"EN-US\">&rdquo;</span>颁发数据资产登记凭证，是对易达科技在<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">数据资产管理和创新应用</strong>方面成果的认可。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 7.8pt; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<p style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 6pt; text-indent: 32.05pt;\">\r\n\t\t<strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">&quot;</span></strong><strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black\">造价指标数字证书<span lang=\"EN-US\">&quot;</span></span></strong><span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;color:black\">通过整合来自广东工程造价大数据交易平台会员单位的数据，涵盖建设单位、勘查单位、设计单位、施工单位、监理单位、财政评审机构以及造价咨询企业所提供的工程造价信息。在确保数据隐私保护、合法合规的前提下，利用人工智能算法对以上数据进行深入分析，提炼出关键指标，并向数据提供者颁发证书以资认证。这一数据产品能够有效证明<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">单个工程项目的基况及其指标的科学性，</strong>未来将广泛应用于<strong style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">投资估算、审核估算的合理性评估以及结算审核</strong>等多个业务场景。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;font-family:华文中宋\"><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<p>\r\n\t\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n\t</section>\r\n\t<p>\r\n\t\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n</section>\r\n<section style=\"margin: 0px; padding: 0px; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; text-align: justify; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-align: center; outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; min-height: 1em; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/456.png\" /><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 38.05pt;\">\r\n\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&ldquo;工程造价咨询企业执业能力数字证书&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">重点应用于</span><span class=\"wxsearchkeywordwrap\"><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; color: var(--weui-LINK); cursor: default; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">造价咨询资质</span></span><span style=\"outline: 0px; max-width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box !important;\">取消后，如何选择企业、规范企业市场行为等场景之中。</span><span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/789(1).png\" /><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 38.05pt;\">\r\n\t\t<strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&ldquo;工程造价咨询企业诚信评价数字证书&rdquo;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">综合行业各协会网站公开的工程造价企业诚信评价数据，在保证数据隐私安全及合法合规的基础上，由广东工程造价大数据交易平台进行分析计算形成诚信指数，并向提供数据的主体颁发证书给予认证。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n\t<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:\r\n.5gd;text-align:center\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://www.gpma.org.cn/userfiles/1/images/cms/article/202407/909.png\" /><o:p></o:p></span></p>\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt;\">\r\n\t\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n\t<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 7.8pt; text-indent: 38pt;\">\r\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">未来，易达科技将继续发挥高新技术企业实力，坚持</span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">&ldquo;咨询<span lang=\"EN-US\">+</span>平台&rdquo;单一责任主体开展全过程造价咨询数字化转型为宗旨，</span></strong><span style=\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; font-size: 16pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: 华文中宋; color: black; letter-spacing: 1.5pt;\">推动工程造价行业数据价值释放，进一步助力行业高质量发展。</span></p>\r\n</section>"}